{"type": "message", "message": "The idea was to make the living area feel **more inviting, not more crowded**:\n\n- **Armchair angled toward the sofa:** encourages conversation rather than separate seating.\n- **A generous rug:** visually ties the seating into one cozy zone.\n- **Textured oatmeal upholstery and wood tables:** add softness and warm tones.\n- **A shaded floor lamp:** offers gentler, localized evening light.\n\nThis was a design concept, not an applied layout; exact furniture positions haven’t been chosen.", "conversationId": "92e39da48faf4b81bdd9bb318878d71f"}
